        "node_id": "n_3_e56a92",
        "thought_text": "Use a graph-based approach where each person is a node and each debt is an edge with a weight. Apply a method like the Floyd-Warshall algorithm to find the shortest paths between all pairs of nodes, which can help in optimizing the debt distribution.",
